      "lineNbr": 46,
      "author": {
        "id": 1306837
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-18T15:18:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "for the onError part, took a look at the CellInfo, the detail is well hidden in the second parameter of the onError.\nHowever for this API, I\u0027m not sure how much we gained from this.\nIt looks like most of our errors are generated from the defined error code.\nThus, the user will still need the public definitions to map what happens, right?\n\nalso +jchalard@ for input.",
      "parentUuid": "2768cc7a_078166ea",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 46,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 46,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "7d1123c5994f3a93c3172a1ffdc8b834d10bfa8e",
