      "writtenOn": "2019-01-17T09:30:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can set up a handler on the binder thread - does it have a looper?\n\nAgree that it might be better to use ConnectivityThread (and maybe even better to have the app pass in a Handler). But we don\u0027t have to do that in this CL.",
