      "writtenOn": "2019-01-18T04:58:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Upload aosp/875738 aka KA02.5 to evaluate this,\nwhich will invoke callback from binder thread and remove the looper/handler/messenger/thread as Nathan suggested.\nBut as mentioned by lorenzo in the offline discuss yesterday, I\u0027m not very sure if the order of callback can be guaranteed even if user provide a single thread executor.",
