      },
      "lineNbr": 87,
      "author": {
        "id": 1306837
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-08T08:05:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the suggestion.\nAnd it is true if we can ditch that it would simplify the architecture.\nBut since the mCallback cannot be passed into ConnectivityService,\n Currently I don\u0027t see a way to invoke callbacks inside service e.g. \nmExecutor.execute(() -\u003e {\n    mCallback.onStarted();\n});\nDo you have any specific idea about it?",
      "parentUuid": "40307fdc_d229593e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 87,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 87,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "7d1123c5994f3a93c3172a1ffdc8b834d10bfa8e",
